    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432120/extras/1fd2e9ae04780299a0377c6809a4d7db.poster.avif?t=1751901158\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432120/extras/1fd2e9ae04780299a0377c6809a4d7db.webp?t=1751901158\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to chaos and adrenaline!</strong><br>Set in the gritty streets of a 90s hip-hop-inspired world, this fast-paced first-person shooter throws you into an arena where <strong>time, crystals, and survival</strong> rule everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every 20 seconds, the rules change:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First phase:</strong> Enemies go invisible. You can\u2019t see them, but you\u2019ll hear every footstep, reload, and whisper. Time to loot up and prepare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Second phase:</strong> Everyone\u2019s visible. It\u2019s showtime \u2014 lock, load, and light up the battlefield!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission</strong> \u2014 collect enough crystals to open the escape portal, or stay and prove you\u2019re the boss.<br>Play solo or in teams, risk everything or make a slick getaway. It\u2019s your call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432120/extras/2889f594fa027fce0c9c876a2cb08abd.poster.avif?t=1751901158\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432120/extras/2889f594fa027fce0c9c876a2cb08abd.webp?t=1751901158\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic 20-Second Phases</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 20 seconds flips the script:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth mode for looting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat mode for pure chaos</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Ammo Worries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons auto-reload \u2014 you focus on killing, not counting bullets.<br>Choose from:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launchers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shotguns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistols</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault rifles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >10 Gritty Urban Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From decaying warehouses to bass-thumping underground clubs:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full of cover, ambush spots, and deadly traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for fast movement and intense close combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432120/extras/215b6d8a9acf41ac0fe97f8bb411d4af.poster.avif?t=1751901158\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432120/extras/215b6d8a9acf41ac0fe97f8bb411d4af.webp?t=1751901158\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic formats:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5v5</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4v4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3v3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic 2v2v2</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Survive for Heaven\u2019s Sake&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold onto your crystals, survive waves of enemies, and fight for your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432120/extras/582d66a6f16b518a8134546100053fed.poster.avif?t=1751901158\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432120/extras/582d66a6f16b518a8134546100053fed.webp?t=1751901158\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalized loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic 90s style</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >90s Hip-Hop Atmosphere</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boombox beats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon-soaked streets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graffiti-covered arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streetwear and swagger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432120/extras/0916de597a5954098dba218fa583664f.poster.avif?t=1751901158\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432120/extras/0916de597a5954098dba218fa583664f.webm?t=1751901158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432120/extras/0916de597a5954098dba218fa583664f.mp4?t=1751901158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crystals Are Everything</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect crystals, open the portal, escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or\u2026 stay, fight, and dominate for bigger rewards</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random Events &amp; Bonuses</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden crystal drops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden traps to catch greedy players off guard</p></li></ul>",
